Choice StudentCompetencyObjectiveSectionOrProgramChoice
    documentation "This choice type allows a student competency objective to be associated with either a section or a program."
    association StudentSectionAssociation
        documentation "Relates the student and section associated with the competency objective."
        is optional collection
    association GeneralStudentProgramAssociation
        documentation "Relates the student and program associated with the competency objective."
        is optional collection
